    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδύω </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδρομ-δύνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Man.
			6.642
		</span></i>), aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέδυν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set upon</i> or <i>so as to</i>
