					2.413
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος μὴ ἐ. ἐπὶ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ παροργισμῷ ὑμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					4.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				24.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.324
			</span></i>.</div>
